---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Rev Al Munday and this personal site.">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Rev, dev, musician and overthinker</p>
      <h1>About me</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        I’m Al Munday. I’m a minister, software developer, musician, and habitual overthinker.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is a place to record the things I’m learning, making, and reflecting on. That includes the Bible
        and theology, songs that help me process my thoughts, and software projects I’ve enjoyed building.
      </p>
      <p>
        It isn’t meant to be a polished portfolio or a publication schedule. It’s a personal stream where all of
        those parts of my life can sit beside one another. If something here is useful, interesting, or helps you
        feel less alone, I’m glad you found it.
      </p>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="mailto:hi@almunday.com">hi@almunday.com</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Alasdair-Munday" rel="me">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/almunday.com" rel="me">Bluesky</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-page header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .about-content a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
</style>
